MDM Migration Administrator Guide
Jamf Pro administrators and endpoint engineering  |  MDM enrollment migration and Platform SSO completion

Purpose
This guide documents the deployment requirements, Jamf parameter configuration, operational sequence, validation points, and troubleshooting data for the enhanced MDM Migration workflow.

 
1. Solution overview
MDM Migration is a Jamf Pro policy script that guides an interactive macOS user through management enrollment renewal. It validates network readiness, temporarily grants and later removes local administrator membership when required, launches the macOS enrollment workflow, validates the resulting MDM state, submits the logged-in username to Jamf, and completes the Platform SSO workflow through PSEUDO.
