7. Validation checklist
• Run /bin/bash -n against the production script before uploading it to Jamf.
• Confirm Parameter 4 blocks a known test prefix and permits an approved network.
• Confirm an active VPN connection produces the disconnect prompt.
• Test a standard user and verify temporary admin membership is removed afterward.
• Test a pre-existing administrator and verify the account remains an administrator.
• Test with PSEUDO absent and confirm the custom event supplied in Parameter 5 installs it.
• Confirm the workflow waits when any required Platform SSO value is absent or empty.
• Confirm PSEUDO launches only after ExtensionIdentifier, AuthenticationMethod, and AccountDisplayName are populated.
• Confirm a nonzero PSEUDO exit code produces a visible failure and a nonzero script result.
• Confirm profiles status reports MDM enrollment as Yes after completion.
