Review the enrollment status captured in the log and confirm all macOS enrollment prompts were completed.
 
9. Change control notes
The enhanced script preserves the original MDM Migration network, VPN, enrollment, Jamf recon, and temporary-administrator workflows. The PSEUDO implementation now matches the verified Repair Device Management behavior by installing PSEUDO through the configurable Parameter 5 custom event when needed, waiting for the required managed Platform SSO values, and validating the PSEUDO exit code before reporting success.
